    <string name="chord_c">C major</string>
    <string name="description_c">C major. G open, C open, E open, A fret 3 with finger 3.</string>
    <string name="tips_c">Place your ring finger just behind A-string fret 3. Let G, C and E ring open. Keep the fingertip rounded.</string>
    <string name="chord_am">A minor</string>
    <string name="description_am">A minor. G fret 2 with finger 2. C, E and A open.</string>
    <string name="tips_am">Place your middle finger just behind G-string fret 2. Leave the other three strings open. Relax your thumb behind the neck.</string>
    <string name="chord_f">F major</string>
    <string name="description_f">F major. G fret 2 with finger 2, C open, E fret 1 with finger 1, A open.</string>
    <string name="tips_f">Keep the Am middle finger in place. Add your index finger at E-string fret 1. Leave enough space for C and A to ring.</string>
    <string name="chord_g">G major</string>
    <string name="description_g">G major. G open, C fret 2 with finger 1, E fret 3 with finger 3, A fret 2 with finger 2.</string>
    <string name="tips_g">Put index on C fret 2, ring on E fret 3 and middle on A fret 2. Let G ring open. Move slowly until the triangle shape feels familiar.</string>
    <string name="steady_fours">Steady Fours</string>
    <string name="steady_fours_guide">One gentle downstroke on each counted beat.</string>
    <string name="steady_fours_spoken">Down, rest, down, rest, down, rest, down, rest</string>
    <string name="gentle_eighths">Gentle Eighths</string>
    <string name="gentle_eighths_guide">Keep downstrokes on numbers and lighter upstrokes between them.</string>
    <string name="gentle_eighths_spoken">Down, up, down, up, down, up, down, up</string>
    <string name="island_strum">Island Strum</string>
    <string name="island_strum_guide">Keep the hand moving on all eight slots; miss the strings on rests.</string>
    <string name="island_strum_spoken">Down, rest, down, up, rest, up, down, up</string>
    <string name="lyrics_lanai">C  |  Am\nMorning light upon the sea\n\nF  |  G\nLittle waves keep time with me\n\nC  |  Am\nFour soft strings and skies of blue\n\nF  |  G\nOne more song for me and you</string>
    <string name="lyrics_sunset">C  |  C\nSoft gold settles on the sand\n\nF  |  F\nEvening breeze will guide my hand\n\nC  |  C\nStep by step my fingers know\n\nG  |  C\nWhere the gentle rhythms go</string>
